2. Consequence
  If |R|<=6 and at most one r in R has gcd(r,14)=7,
  then the union of forbidden shift classes has size at most 12:
    no half-step: six ordinary speeds forbid at most 6*2=12 shifts;
    one half-step: it forbids one parity class, and each ordinary
      speed contributes at most one new shift in the opposite parity,
      so at most 7+5=12 shifts.

